=========================================================================
Packet trace test: recirc: recirculate once
A 1-byte packet with value 0x00 is recirculated by the egress pipeline, so it enters the ingress and egress pipelines twice: the config-baked default actions run t_loopback on both passes and t_recirc only on the first (the egress conditional is false once hdrA1.f1 is 0x01). The second pass is proven by the output: re-parsing the recirculated 2-byte packet rewrites hdrA2.f1 to 0xab. The recirculated packet copy currently produces no additional trace events.
=========================================================================
